        "raw": "<p>When you reveal an assassin by drawig a crad, you still draw a card after the assassin does its stuff.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>So you tried to draw a card but got an assassin, the assassin entered play and you drew again. You drew another assassin who entered play and try to draw again only to draw the last assassin who entered play. Then you finally got to draw your own card and be able to search the deck.</p>",
